Enumeration base:
    Enumerator first as 4.
End enumeration.
Enumeration flags:
    Enumerator none as 0.
    Enumerator read as 1.
    Enumerator write as (Enumerator read of flags shifted left by 1).
    Enumerator both as (Enumerator read of flags bitwise or Enumerator write of flags).
    Enumerator wide as (Enumerator first of base times 10 plus Size of type integer).
    Enumerator cast as Convert 300 to type unsigned character.
    Enumerator next.
End enumeration.
Say Enumerator write of flags.
Say Enumerator both of flags.
Say Enumerator wide of flags.
Say Enumerator cast of flags.
Say Enumerator next of flags.
